   "design": "The evaluation form in the performance module of the {HCM} opens with last year's goals and the job details filled in, and the year's notes on the employee sit in the same place. The senior worker records the evaluation there after the talk; once the centre manager co-signs, the system files it in the personnel file. Observing and the talk stay in person, and no AI rates staff.",
   "previous_blocker": "Forms were paper, copied from last year and carried to HR.",
   "enabler_now": "HCM performance modules carry goals forward and file signed evaluations.",
   "still_hard": "A fair evaluation is judgement and needs the employee's voice.",
   "human_edge": "Telling a colleague honestly what to improve while keeping their trust.",
